<object #orders.order { kind = "entity" fact_grade = "authoritative_fact" single_writer = "modeling://domain/orders/orders_module" } [
  <desc ?>
  一张订单：从下单到履约的聚合根。状态由事件投影，金额是只读派生。
  </?>
  <types ?ts_order>
  interface Order {
    id: string
    customerId: string
    status: OrderStatus
    lines: OrderLine[]
    couponId: string | null   // 【本 track 新增】优惠券
    total: Money
  }
  interface OrderLine { sku: string; qty: number; unitPrice: Money }
  </?ts_order>
  <fact-source ?>
  唯一写入者 = orders_module；total 是 derived_projection_cache，由 lines 投影，不反写。
  </?>
  <invariants ?>
  同一 order 内 sku 不重复；total = Σ(line.qty × line.unitPrice)；couponId 须引用 valid coupon；删除走软删 cancelled。
  </?>
  <not-owned-here ?>
  库存扣减属 inventory context，本节点经 message 请求，不直写。
  </?>
]>

<enum #orders.order_status { kind = "enum" } [
  <types ?ts_status>
  enum OrderStatus { Draft="draft", Placed="placed", Paid="paid", Shipped="shipped", Cancelled="cancelled", Refunded="refunded" }
  </?ts_status>
]>

<state-machine #orders.order_lifecycle { kind = "state-machine" } [
  <desc ?>
  订单状态机：合法迁移与触发事件。【本 track 新增 refund】
  </?>
  <mermaid ?mm_life>
  stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft
    draft --> placed: place
    placed --> paid: pay
    paid --> shipped: ship
    paid --> refunded: refund
    draft --> cancelled: cancel
    placed --> cancelled: cancel
  </?mm_life>
]>

<policy #orders.refund_policy { kind = "policy" behaviors = ["behavior://orders/requirements/refund-window"] } [
  <desc ?>
  【本 track 新增】退款规则：付款后 N 天内可退，已发货按比例。
  </?>
  <pseudo { kind = "rule" } ?ps_refund>
  refundable(order) :- status(order, paid), within(order.paidAt, 7d).
  </?ps_refund>
]>
